---
/**
 * Disclaimer — static page. Honest limitations: AI output is informational,
 * numerical results are estimates, and math should be verified independently.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Disclaimer for the AI Graphing Calculator: AI answers and numerical results are informational; verify important calculations independently."
  canonicalPath="/disclaimer/"
  mainClass="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:py-14"
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Disclaimer</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Last updated: September 29, 2026</p>

  <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
    <h2 class="pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
      AI assistant output is informational
    </h2>
    <p>
      The built-in AI math assistant explains concepts and interprets requests in plain language,
      but it can make mistakes — including confidently stated ones. Treat AI answers as a starting
      point, not as authoritative mathematics.
    </p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
      Numerical results are computed, not proven
    </h2>
    <p>
      Roots, derivatives, integrals, limits, and other analysis results are computed numerically
      with floating-point arithmetic. They are accurate to the displayed precision under normal
      conditions, but rounding and sampling can introduce small errors — especially near
      discontinuities, sharp corners, or asymptotes. For homework, exams, engineering, or any
      decision that matters, verify important calculations independently.
    </p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
      No professional advice
    </h2>
    <p>
      Nothing on this site constitutes professional advice of any kind — mathematical, educational,
      financial, or otherwise. The content is provided for general educational purposes.
    </p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
      Your graphs stay yours
    </h2>
    <p>
      Graphs you save are stored only in your own browser. Shared links encode the graph in the link
      itself, so anyone with the link can open it. Do not share links containing anything you would
      not want others to see.
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm">
      By using this site you accept that its authors are not liable for decisions made on the basis
      of its output. See the Terms of Service for details.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
